<figure class="my-12 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 sm:p-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
    <div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4 text-sm">
        <span class="text-copy">Une page web moyenne, sur mobile</span>
        <span class="font-semibold text-ink">{{ (weight.median / 1000).toFixed(1) | replace(".", ",") }}&nbsp;Mo</span>
      </div>
      <svg class="mt-2 block h-3 w-full" viewBox="0 0 100 4" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect width="100" height="4" class="fill-border-field"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4 text-sm">
        <span class="text-copy">La page d'accueil de ce site</span>
        <span class="font-semibold text-ink">moins de 0,1&nbsp;Mo</span>
      </div>
      <svg class="mt-2 block h-3 w-full" viewBox="0 0 100 4" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect width="{{ (weight.site / weight.median * 100) | round(2) }}" height="4" class="fill-ocean"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="mt-6 border-t border-border pt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Quantité de données qu'un téléphone télécharge pour afficher la page. Page moyenne : <a href="https://almanac.httparchive.org/en/2024/page-weight" class="underline underline-offset-2">Web Almanac 2024</a>. Ce site : mesuré le {{ weight.measured }}.</figcaption>
</figure>
